  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.740" end="00:03.600" ttm:agent="v1">I don't want to waste your time</p>
      <p begin="00:03.600" end="00:07.060" ttm:agent="v1">Just want to feel the air on my body</p>
      <p begin="00:07.060" end="00:13.970" ttm:agent="v1">And I roll the window down, don't ever think I'll be this happy</p>
      <p begin="00:13.970" end="00:21.810" ttm:agent="v1">You know I love autonomy</p>
      <p begin="00:21.810" end="00:25.080" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause fame is a disease</p>
      <p begin="00:25.080" end="00:26.580" ttm:agent="v1">And</p>
      <p begin="00:25.160" end="00:31.110" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="00:31.110" end="00:37.540" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="00:37.540" end="00:43.810" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="00:43.810" end="00:49.580" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="00:49.580" end="00:52.470" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:52.470" end="00:59.690" ttm:agent="v1">And I feel the sky falling down on the road</p>
      <p begin="00:59.690" end="01:06.190" ttm:agent="v1">Be precious with my heart, drive me slow</p>
      <p begin="01:06.190" end="01:12.690" ttm:agent="v1">Just be kind, I'm a child again</p>
      <p begin="01:12.690" end="01:15.420" ttm:agent="v1">And no child deserves suffering</p>
      <p begin="01:15.420" end="01:16.920" ttm:agent="v1">And</p>
      <p begin="01:16.330" end="01:21.580" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="01:21.580" end="01:27.850" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="01:27.850" end="01:34.340" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="01:34.340" end="01:38.500" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="01:38.500" end="01:41.700" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:41.700" end="01:44.790" ttm:agent="v1">I don't want to waste your time</p>
      <p begin="01:44.790" end="01:48.120" ttm:agent="v1">Just want to feel the air on my body</p>
      <p begin="01:48.120" end="01:54.980" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma roll the window down, don't ever think I'll be this happy again</p>
      <p begin="01:54.980" end="02:02.980" ttm:agent="v1">You'll always be a part of me, just turn the key</p>
      <p begin="02:06.250" end="02:07.750" ttm:agent="v1">And</p>
      <p begin="02:06.430" end="02:12.220" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="02:12.220" end="02:18.430" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="02:18.430" end="02:24.790" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
      <p begin="02:24.790" end="02:31.580" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I just want to drive, I just want to drive</p>
